    "innovation": "This paper simulates future eutrophication scenarios to demonstrate that increased nutrient loading will substantially increase methane emissions from lakes and impoundments by 30-90% over the 21st century, representing a significant positive feedback on climate change equivalent to 18-33% of annual fossil fuel CO\u2082 emissions.",
